[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 33841.67, "timestamp": "09:24:01", "text": "哦，飛行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33847.95, "timestamp": "09:24:07", "text": "。是啊，航班。好的，我們又獲得了更多馬裡奧關卡。  [音樂] 雖然現在這更像是馬裡奧銀河了。等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33863.67, "timestamp": "09:24:23", "text": "好的。我覺得就在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33884.83, "timestamp": "09:24:44", "text": "這裡。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33888.19, "timestamp": "09:24:48", "text": "。  哇"}]